  "items": [
    {
      "source": "Chaining is correctly handled, ensuring that only one <a href=\"../framework/ProxyFactoryBean.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.aop.framework\"><code>ProxyFactoryBean</code></a> definition\nis created. If a previous <a href=\"../../beans/factory/xml/BeanDefinitionDecorator.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.xml\"><code>BeanDefinitionDecorator</code></a>\nalready created the <a href=\"../framework/ProxyFactoryBean.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.aop.framework\"><code>ProxyFactoryBean</code></a> then the\ninterceptor is simply added to the existing definition.",
      "translation": "链式调用被正确处理，确保只创建一个<a href=\"../framework/ProxyFactoryBean.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.aop.framework\"><code>ProxyFactoryBean</code></a>定义。如果之前的<a href=\"../../beans/factory/xml/BeanDefinitionDecorator.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.xml\"><code>BeanDefinitionDecorator</code></a>已经创建了该<a href=\"../framework/ProxyFactoryBean.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.aop.framework\"><code>ProxyFactoryBean</code></a>，则只需将拦截器添加到现有定义中。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "This base class controls the creation of the <a href=\"../framework/ProxyFactoryBean.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.aop.framework\"><code>ProxyFactoryBean</code></a> bean definition\nand wraps the original as an inner-bean definition for the <code>target</code> property\nof <a href=\"../framework/ProxyFactoryBean.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.aop.framework\"><code>ProxyFactoryBean</code></a>.",
      "translation": "这个基类控制 <a href=\"../framework/ProxyFactoryBean.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.aop.framework\"><code>ProxyFactoryBean</code></a>  bean 定义的创建，并将原始对象包装为 <a href=\"../framework/ProxyFactoryBean.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.aop.framework\"><code>ProxyFactoryBean</code></a> 的 <code>target</code> 属性的内部 bean 定义。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Implementations may choose to return a completely new definition, which will\nreplace the original definition in the resulting\n<a href=\"../../beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a>.",
      "translation": "实现可以选择返回一个全新的定义，该定义将替换结果中\n<a href=\"../../beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a> 的原始定义。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "The supplied <a href=\"../../beans/factory/xml/ParserContext.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.beans.factory.xml\"><code>ParserContext</code></a> can be used to register any additional\nbeans needed to support the main definition.",
      "translation": "提供的<a href=\"../../beans/factory/xml/ParserContext.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.beans.factory.xml\"><code>ParserContext</code></a>可用于注册任何支持主定义所需的附加 bean。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Subclasses have only to create the <code>BeanDefinition</code> to the interceptor that\nthey wish to add.",
      "translation": "子类只需创建要添加的拦截器的<code>BeanDefinition</code>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Parse the specified <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.xml/org/w3c/dom/Node.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.w3c.dom\"><code>Node</code></a> (either an element or an attribute) and decorate\nthe supplied <a href=\"../../beans/factory/config/BeanDefinition.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.config\"><code>BeanDefinition</code></a>,\nreturning the decorated definition.",
      "translation": "解析指定的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.xml/org/w3c/dom/Node.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.w3c.dom\"><code>Node</code></a>（元素或属性），并装饰提供的<a href=\"../../beans/factory/config/BeanDefinition.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.config\"><code>BeanDefinition</code></a>，返回装饰后的定义。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">Description copied from interface: <code><a href=\"../../beans/factory/xml/BeanDefinitionDecorator.html#decorate(org.w3c.dom.Node,org.springframework.beans.factory.config.BeanDefinitionHolder,org.springframework.beans.factory.xml.ParserContext)\">BeanDefinitionDecorator</a></code></span>",
      "translation": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">描述从接口复制：<code><a href=\"../../beans/factory/xml/BeanDefinitionDecorator.html#decorate(org.w3c.dom.Node,org.springframework.beans.factory.config.BeanDefinitionHolder,org.springframework.beans.factory.xml.ParserContext)\">BeanDefinitionDecorator</a></code></span>",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Subclasses should implement this method to return the <code>BeanDefinition</code>\nfor the interceptor they wish to apply to the bean being decorated.",
      "translation": "子类应实现此方法，以返回要应用于被装饰 Bean 的拦截器的<code>BeanDefinition</code>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a href=\"../../beans/factory/xml/BeanDefinitionDecorator.html#decorate(org.w3c.dom.Node,org.springframework.beans.factory.config.BeanDefinitionHolder,org.springframework.beans.factory.xml.ParserContext)\">decorate</a></code> in interface <code><a href=\"../../beans/factory/xml/BeanDefinitionDecorator.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.xml\">BeanDefinitionDecorator</a></code>",
      "translation": "`<code><a href=\"../../beans/factory/xml/BeanDefinitionDecorator.html#decorate(org.w3c.dom.Node,org.springframework.beans.factory.config.BeanDefinitionHolder,org.springframework.beans.factory.xml.ParserContext)\">decorate</a></code>` 接口 `<code><a href=\"../../beans/factory/xml/BeanDefinitionDecorator.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.xml\">BeanDefinitionDecorator</a></code>`",
      "count": 2
    },
